     5        NOBLK, KDAY, KMO, KYR, KPAGE, NPAGE, SPARE, LY, R, C, D,  ERTS0816
     6        O, S, CI                                                  ERTS0817
C                                                                       ERTS0818
C                                                                       ERTS0819
C     TABLE 19  PERCENT CHANGE FROM PRECEDING MONTH, ORIGINAL SERIES    ERTS0820
C                                                                       ERTS0821
 3420 XN1=N1                                                            ERTS0822
