C                                                                       ERTS0940
C     TABLE 26  MOVING AVERAGE OF FINAL SEASONALLY ADJUSTED SERIES,     ERTS0941
C               LENGTH TO EQUAL NUMBER OF MONTHS FOR CYCLICAL DOMINANCE ERTS0942
 4100 KK = 26                                                           ERTS0943
