C               RELATIONS, AND AVERAGE DURATION OF RUNS                 ERTS1013
 4700 IF(MCD) 4702, 4702, 4708                                          ERTS1014
 4702 ADRMA = 0.0                                                       ERTS1015
 4704 GO TO 4870                                                        ERTS1016
 4708 ASSIGN 4860 TO M                                                  ERTS1017
 4710 DO 4720 I=1,N1                                                    ERTS1018
 4720 STA(I) = (TOC(I+1)/TOC(I)-1.0)*100.0                              ERTS1019
 4760 Z=1.                                                              ERTS1020
