C     TABLE 28  RATIOS OF 12-MONTH MOVING AVERAGES, IRREGULAR AMPLITUDE ERTS1064
C               TO CYCLICAL AMPLITUDE                                   ERTS1065
 5100 ERC(1) = 0.0                                                      ERTS1066
 5115 TOC(1) = 0.0                                                      ERTS1067
