      SUBROUTINE FORCST                                                 ERTS1106
C                                                                       ERTS1107
      DIMENSION   LR(50), X(372), K(50), RA(372), A(372), OMA(372),     ERTS1108
     1            CMA(372), ROC(372), B(372), UCL(372), BCL(372),       ERTS1109
